"""CorkyTux heroic-store plugin: Epic Games + GOG via legendary/gogdl.

Same pattern Heroic itself uses: shell out to these binaries, parse
their output, stream progress as JSON lines. Games live in CorkyTux's
native library (no separate store library); EAC/BattlEye runtime flags
come from Heroic's per-game config on scan.
"""

